                                "sense_id": "91a94df5-7273-347d-8266-4feacea6365d",
                                "text": "The allotype need not be described by the protologist (first describer) ; it can be contained in the original as well as in any subsequent description by other authors."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be7672b5-c0c1-44b9-a121-554df77d00f6",
                                "sense_id": "91a94df5-7273-347d-8266-4feacea6365d",
                                "text": "Therefore, to rectify this long standing error, we are compelled to expunge Fairmaire's name as the author of the name and substitute Felsche as the true protologist."
                            },
